    "northStar": "Delegation Ledger",
    "overview": "The implemented Operate interface uses muted paper, green actions and ruled sections. Russian controls, visible document previews and compact evidence records support inspection of a synthetic delegation case. The approved three-panel architecture is preserved.\n\nRecorded from the dashboard template, stylesheet and desktop, tablet and mobile captures in `artifacts/ledger-*.png`. These are implementation observations, not a visual-comp comparison or owner UAT result.",
